      "created_at": "2025-07-01T01:36:45.452Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When i run <code>bench migrate</code> in backend container</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/1/71462a4d81649c8f349c87bbc3452dc72aee5515.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/71462a4d81649c8f349c87bbc3452dc72aee5515\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/1/71462a4d81649c8f349c87bbc3452dc72aee5515.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ga4hvWSYbe7YUrKReTxMhEqhxtP\" width=\"690\" height=\"138\" data-dominant-color=\"161413\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1059×212 5.25 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\nits stuck on this patch update</p>\n<p>This is the patch on github update which runs:<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/blob/version-15/frappe/patches/v16_0/enable_setup_complete.py\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Patch v16_0 </a></p>",
