      "id": 473105,
      "username": "julez",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-07-03T14:40:37.926Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had the same problem, after updating my custom app, building a new image and pulling it onto my production docker instance I tried to migrate. Like in your picture above it got stuck for me too.</p>\n<p>However, after aborting and restarting the migration process multiple times, I then let it run for a few minutes and surprisingly it went through.</p>\n<p>So try to just let it run and sit there for 5-10 minutes, that fixed it for me.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/9/2949185b3ee1076970a404c05f54a88015d196b8.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/2949185b3ee1076970a404c05f54a88015d196b8\" title=\"grafik\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/9/2949185b3ee1076970a404c05f54a88015d196b8.png\" alt=\"grafik\" data-base62-sha1=\"5TebhfTvD7FfwITiehOLBRrNaWY\" width=\"690\" height=\"118\" data-dominant-color=\"303030\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">grafik</span><span class=\"informations\">1309×225 20.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
